<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JUD" style="id">- ZARAMO Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">YUDA</para>
  <para style="toc1">LUPWILILI LWANDIKIGWE NA YUDA</para>
  <para style="toc2">YUDA</para>
  <para style="toc3">Yud.</para>
  <para style="mt2">LUPWILILI LWANDIKIGWE NA</para>
  <para style="mt1">YUDA</para>
  <para style="imt">ULONGOZI</para>
  <para style="ip">Yuda dijo twaga da munhu yandike lupwilili luno. Kakitambula mwenyego kamba heyo mdodo wake Yakobo, yakalile mdodo wake Yesu (1:1). Hatuvitanga kamba lupwilili luno lwandikigwa sama ya wanhu wamtogole Kilisto weiyeka, na kwavija ng'humbukila za Lagano da Umwaka zolonga, vodahika kamba wasomaji zake wakala Wayahudi. Hata avo, lupwilili lwake kaupeta ha wose wakemigwe, mdinoge da Mulungu Tata, na wekigwe sama ya Yesu Kilisto (1:1). Vodahika lupwilili luno lwandikigwa mmilao ya 60 songela kuvumbuka kwa Kilisto.</para>
  <para style="ip">Kilamso cha kwandika lupwilili luno ha wanhu wose wamtogole Kilisto kikala kuwazuma sambiwavwiziligwe na wakulufunzi wa uvwizi (1:4). Kokumbukila simulila za Lagano da Umwaka na kugangamiza simulila zake. Lupwilili luno lulinga ng'hani na lupwilili lwa ikabili lwa Petulo mkuwazuma waiteganye na wakulufunzi wa uvwizi (1:4 na 2Petulo 2:1) kamba vija ng'humbukila za wasenga wa Mulungu wa kuulanga na viwambo va Sodoma na Gomola.</para>
  <para style="iot">Gali Mgati ya Ikitabu</para>
  <para style="io1">1. Haichanduso Yuda kowapetela wasomaji zake (<char style="ior"><ref loc="JUD 1:1-2">1:1-2</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">2. Abaho kolava kilamso chake cha kwandika nzuma ya kuiteganya na wakulufunzi wa uvwizi (<char style="ior"><ref loc="JUD 1:3-4">1:3-4</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">3. Abaho kawagwelela ningo kulawa ha wanhu na mbuli zilawilile za Lagano da Umwaka (<char style="ior"><ref loc="JUD 1:5-16">1:5-16</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">4. Abaho kawalongela watogole nzuma yowogweleligwa (<char style="ior"><ref loc="JUD 1:17-23">1:17-23</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">5. Hakimambukizo, keshilizila lupwilili lwake mkumtambikila Mulungu (<char style="ior"><ref loc="JUD 1:24-25">1:24-25</ref></char>).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JUD 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JUD 1:1"/>Lupwilili luno lolawa ha Yuda, nyakadala wa Yesu Kilisto na mdodo wa Yakobo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JUD 1:1">Nowandikila awo wakemigwe na Mulungu Tata, ayo yowanogela mweye na kuwemiliza mweye mmakono ga Yesu Kilisto. <verse eid="JUD 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JUD 1:2"/>Mulungu yawagwelele bazi, tindiwalo, na noge bwando.<verse eid="JUD 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wakulufunzi wa Uvwizi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JUD 1:3"/>Mbwiga zangu, niiyoha ng'hani kuwandikila mweye mbuli ya ukombola utuusangila songela haichanduso. Ila kipigiti kikija nigelegeza tanhu niwandikile mbuli za kuwagangamiza mweye mgendelele kuigombela nhamanila ayo Mulungu iyawagwelele wanhu zake wose mwanza umwe. <verse eid="JUD 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JUD 1:4"/>Kwavija kuna wanhu wandikiligwe nhaguso ino milao bwando ibitile, waibitiza kinyele wengila mmwenu. Wanhu walibule kidumbo cha Mulungu, waigalula ngekewa ya Mulungu wetu mkutenda gehile na kumulema Mkulu na Mndewa wetu, Yesu Kilisto. <verse eid="JUD 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JUD 1:5"/>Hata kamba mzimanya mbuli zino zose, nolonda niwakumbuse mweye kamba, Mndewa kawakombola wanhu zake kulawa Misili, ila hamwande kawabananga awo walekile kumtogola. <verse eid="JUD 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JUD 1:6"/>Na wasenga wa Mulungu wa kuulanga walemile kukala hanhu hayawagwelele Mulungu na kusegela kulawa hanhu hawagweleligwe na Mulungu, Mulungu kawafudika na minyolo haidaha kukanhika na kuweka mkifungo cha ziza wobeta zua dija idikulu da nhaguso. <verse eid="JUD 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JUD 1:7"/>Sambimuisemwe miwambo ya Sodoma na Gomola na viwambo viyagwe vili behi na hiyo, wenekae zao viwamemile sulukila ya kutenda ugoni chaka na kuiwasa wambigalo kwa wambigalo. Viwambo vija vibanangigwa mkusomigwa moto, mbuli ino ikigwa iwe kamba kilingilo cha moto wa digunge kudizua da nhaguso na nzuma ha wanhu wose.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbuli zino zolawa mkitabu cha </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 19:1-24">MWANDUSO 19:1-24</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="JUD 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JUD 1:8"/>Vivija na wanhu wano wokemigwa walota nzozi, wozinyolodosa ng'huli zao, na kuulema udaho wa Mulungu, na kuvilonga vihile vinhu vilumbigwe vili kuulanga. <verse eid="JUD 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JUD 1:9"/>Hata mkulu wa wasenga wa Mulungu wa kuulanga yokemigwa Mikaeli, kipigiti viyakalile yoibamilila na Mwenembago wogombela lukuli lwa Musa, hagezile kumdukumiza na kumulonga vihile, ila kalonga “Mndewa yakukomhokele.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbuli zino zolawa mkitabu cha </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="DAN 10:13">DANIELI 10:13</ref>, <ref loc="DAN 10:21">21</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 12:1">12:1</ref></char>; <char style="xt"><ref loc="REV 12:7">LUGUBULO 12:7</ref></char>; <char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 34:6">NG'HUMBUKILA YA TOLATI 34:6</ref></char>; <char style="xt"><ref loc="ZEC 3:2">ZAKALIA 3:2</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="JUD 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JUD 1:10"/>Ila wanhu wano wozilonga vihile mbuli zozose ziwalekile kuzitanga, na zija zowozitanga muinzoela yao, wowa kamba wang'onyo wa kumuhulo, avo wobanangigwa na mbuli hizo. <verse eid="JUD 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JUD 1:11"/>Wojona! Waigogile nzila ya Kaini, wakimbilila kupata ugoli kamba viyatendile Balaamu, na waibananga kamba Kola viyalondile kumuhindula Musa.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbuli zino zolawa mkitabu cha </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 4:3-8">MWANDUSO 4:3-8</ref></char>; <char style="xt"><ref loc="NUM 22:1-35">MHETA 22:1-35</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 16:35">16:35</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="JUD 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JUD 1:12"/>Wanhu wano kamba minyela mzisona zenu za udugu wa Ukilisto, avija viwoja namwe bila kidumbo wokiidima wenyego. Hewo wa kamba mawingu galibule mazi gohembeluswa na beho, na wa kamba mibiki ilagaze mitepo yake, ilibule mujo, ifile mianza mibili, tena ing'oligwe. <verse eid="JUD 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JUD 1:13"/>Walinga na mawimbi makulu ga bahali, wolagusa kinyala chao kamba holovu da bahali. Walinga na nhondo zitembela, wageligwa ziza kulu da milongo yose sama yao.<verse eid="JUD 1:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JUD 1:14"/>Vino vivo Henoko yakalile wa mulelo wa saba kulawa Adamu viyahokole yolonga, “Lola, Mndewa kokwiza na wasenga zake wang'alile wa kuulanga, maalufu kwa maalufu,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbuli zino zolawa mkitabu cha </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 5:18">MWANDUSO 5:18</ref>, <ref loc="GEN 5:21-24">21-24</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="JUD 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JUD 1:15"/>kumtagusa kila munhu na kuweka hamgwazo Wamhazi wose sama ya sang'hano zao za kimhazi ziwatendile muumhazi wao na mmbuli zose zihile ziwalongile Wamhazi womulonga heyo.”<verse eid="JUD 1:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JUD 1:16"/>Wanhu wano hawesha kutwanganika na kuwadeta wayao, na wowinza sulukila zao za mbuli zihile. Wolonga mbuli za matopa na kuwatogola wanhu giladi wapate vinhu kulawa kumwao.<verse eid="JUD 1:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nzuma na Ndagizi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JUD 1:17"/>Ila mweye mbwiga zangu iniwanogele ng'hani, kumbukileni goya nzuma ya watumigwa wa Mndewa wetu Yesu Kilisto. <verse eid="JUD 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JUD 1:18"/>Wawalongela “Kuna gamazua ga ikimambukizo, wolawilila waponela wondawawinze sulukila zao zihile za umhazi.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbuli zino zolawa mkitabu cha </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="2PE 3:3">2PETULO 3:3</ref></char>. </note> <verse eid="JUD 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JUD 1:19"/>Wanhu wano wawo wogala mbagu, wolongozwa na sulukila zao za lukuli, na wabule Loho wa Mulungu. <verse eid="JUD 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JUD 1:20"/>Ila mweye, mbwiga zangu iniwanogele ng'hani, izengeni mnhamanila yenu ing'alile ng'hani na tambikeni kubitila Loho wa Mulungu. <verse eid="JUD 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JUD 1:21"/>Kaleni mdinoge da Mulungu, kuno mobeta bazi da Mndewa wetu Yesu Kilisto da kuwagala mweye kuna ugima wa digunge.<verse eid="JUD 1:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JUD 1:22"/>Woneleni bazi awo wodungwadungwa, <verse eid="JUD 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JUD 1:23"/>wayagwe wakomboleni mkuwanyamula kulawa mmoto wa nhaguso, na ha wanhu wayagwe laguseni bazi na bwembwe mmioyo yenu, ila molondigwa mkihile hata kivalo kinyolodoswe na ng'huli zao.<verse eid="JUD 1:23"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nhambiko ya Kuyenzi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JUD 1:24"/>Hamwake heyo yodaha kuwatenda mweye sambimgwe na kuweka mweye kuna iyenzi yake bila king'hwaso ila na ndeng'helelo ng'hulu, <verse eid="JUD 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JUD 1:25"/>ha Mulungu yali yeiyeka Mkombola wetu kubitila Yesu Kilisto Mndewa wetu, yenzi yose, ukulu, mhiko, na udaho, vose vake heyo, songela mwaka na sambi na hata milongo yose. Amina.<verse eid="JUD 1:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JUD 1"/>
</usx>
